<title>ITALY: Italy to fall short of 3pct deficit/GDP goal -IMF.</title>
<headline>Italy to fall short of 3pct deficit/GDP goal -IMF.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy will fall short in its bid to meet the deficit/GDP target for EMU aspirants in 1997 and will need structural cuts to social spending to safeguard state accounts, the International Monetary Fund said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its World Economic Outlook, the IMF said Italy had made &quot;considerable progress&quot; in cutting inflation and boosting credibility over its commitment to cut the budget deficit.</p>
</text>
